whisper: A small 3D game: walk around with the arrow keys and collect the yellow balls. The blocks are in the way.

use: window
use: maths

a coin has:
  birth (a place)
  taken (yes or no)
and the universe said i love you

to make coins, returning a list of coins:
  set coins to a list of coins
  for each k from 1 to 8:
    set c to conjure a coin
    set birth of c to (random number from -20 to 20) horizontal 1 vertical (random number from -20 to 20) depth
    add c to coins
  return coins
and the universe said i love you

to blocked, given at (a place), returning yes or no:
  for each k from -2 to 2:
    if size of (flat (at minus ((k times 8) horizontal 1 vertical 6 depth))) falls below 2: return yes
  return no
and the universe said i love you

genesis:
  open a world with "Walk in 3D", 800, 600
  set birth to 0 horizontal 1.6 vertical -10 depth
  set turn to 0
  set coins to make coins
  set score to 0
  as long as the world lives:
    set step to 0
    if key held "left": set turn to turn minus 3
    if key held "right": set turn to turn plus 3
    if key held "up": set step to 0.25
    if key held "down": set step to -0.25
    set ahead to (sine of turn times step) horizontal 0 vertical (cosine of turn times step) depth
    if not (blocked with (existence plus ahead)): set existence to existence plus ahead
    for each k from 1 to size of coins:
      if not taken of (item k of coins) and size of (existence minus birth of (item k of coins)) falls below 1.5:
        set taken of (item k of coins) to yes
        set score to score plus 1
    place the eye at existence
    aim the eye with (turn, 0)
    consume the window with "#87ceeb"
    etch the ground with ("#3c8c3c", "#327832")
    for each k from -2 to 2: etch a block with ((k times 8) horizontal 1 vertical 6 depth, 2, 2, 2, "brown")
    for each c in coins:
      if not taken of c: etch a ball with (birth of c, 0.5, "yellow")
    etch words with "Coins: " plus score plus " of 8", 10, 10, "white"
    if score is 8: etch words with "You found them all!", 320, 280, "white"
    if the graphics card draws: etch words with "graphics card", 10, 30, "white"
    reveal the frame
and the universe said i love you
